// unsigned whole numbers
// ----------------------
// bit/boolean is 1 bits
// crumb is 2 bits
// nibble is 4 bits
// byte is 8 bits

// signed whole numbers
// --------------------
// word is 16 bits (unsigned)
// short is 16 bits (signed)
// integer is 64 (signed)
// long is 64 bits (unsigned)

